#20800
The Road of Open Graves~
   The road from Vel'Morrow runs west between graves, rows upon rows of them
on both sides, every one dug open from beneath. Their headstones lean like
bad teeth. The names on them are in a hundred languages, from a hundred
kingdoms the West has swallowed.
~
