#20801
The Sea of Graves~
   Graves cover the grey hills from horizon to horizon like the waves of a
frozen sea. Here and there a skeletal hand reaches from the earth, or a
skull turns to follow you. Wind moans over the stones. You could walk for
days and never see the end of them.
~
