The Titan's Hollow~
   A great hollow between hills where the bones of giants have been
assembled into a titan taller than a tower, still being built. Grey servants
climb over it on ladders, binding bones with wire and black rope. Its skull,
a giant's skull as big as a house, turns toward you.
