#20809
The Gate of the Necropolis~
   At the heart of the Bone Fields stands a city built entirely of bone:
walls of femurs, towers of skulls, gates of ribcages. Grey fire burns in
every empty eye socket. Two dread knights on skeletal horses guard the gate.
~
