#20810
The Street of Skulls~
   A street paved with skulls, set close like cobbles, every one grinning up
at you. The buildings on either side are built of long bones, roofed with
shoulder blades. Bone-weavers sit in the doorways, working bones into new
shapes with their hands.
~
