#20815
The Gravelord's Sanctum~
   A round chamber at the heart of the necropolis, its walls lined with the
crowns of every king the West has buried. In its centre, on a throne of
skulls, sits the Gravelord, who raises the West's armies from the dead. He
was the first mortal to bow to Nu'Groth, and he has been dead for longer
than Midgaard has stood.
