#20816
The Western Barrow-Lands~
   Beyond the necropolis the graves thin out at last, and the land rises
toward a wall of broken mountains, their peaks split and jagged against the
dark sky. A path climbs toward a great gate cut into the rock, and from it
comes the distant ring of hammers.
~
